WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
Muslims believe God sent
prophets to every people,

2
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:07.020
beginning with Adam, then
Ibrahim, and many more.

3
00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:10.200
Each one, they believe,
was a human messenger,

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.950
calling people back to the one God.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.660
Then the chain reaches
one last name: Muhammad.

6
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.030
The Qur'an gives him a title: the Seal.

7
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.340
What does that title mean to Muslims?

8
00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:25.680
And why does being the
last matter so much?

9
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:30.000
In this mission, you'll read the
words the Qur'an uses to describe him.

10
00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:34.110
Then you'll weigh up whether he
is the most important prophet.

11
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:39.310
Your mission: find out why being the
last prophet matters so much to Muslims.
